The plate looks like a dinner plate of about 26 cm, so I used that as the scale. It holds roughly 8 french fries, each about 6-7 cm long and thin, around 1 cm wide. A fry of that size weighs roughly 5-6 g, so the total is about 45 g.

French fries run about 3 kcal/g, which gives roughly 135 kcal.

